From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 11:09:48 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] raumata: add shared PHY profiles and preset selection

Add a first-class PhyProfile table and NVS persistence (raumata/phy) covering Meshtastic presets, MeshCore narrow presets, dual presets (0x2B and 0x12 sync words), and user-defined custom profiles.

- Apply the active profile in phyInit() before initLoRa() and drive RadioInterface syncWord and preambleLength from the profile.
- Expose preset selection and custom radio parameters through companion commands (CMD_SET_RADIO_PARAMS, CMD_SET_RADIO_TX_POWER, CMD_GET_PHY_PROFILES, CMD_GET_PHY_PROFILE, CMD_SET_PHY_PROFILE) and the 'phy' CLI command.

